/Title (Conclusion : In this case study, we successfully created an Online Job Application Form using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. We implemented form validation, event handling, and dynamic message display. This activity helped us understand how JavaScript can be used to access form elements, validate user input, and improve the functionality of web forms.)
